WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.621
The Patch Bay also routes the picture itself.

2
00:00:03.621 --> 00:00:05.244
Video cables are magenta.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.985
Load a video into Video Source A, with its File button.

4
00:00:09.435 --> 00:00:11.675
Open its preview to check that it is playing.

5
00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:16.447
Now patch the Pattern Generator's video output into Composite's B input.

6
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.340
Set the Composite blend to Screen, so both pictures show.

7
00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:24.303
Finally, patch Composite's output into the Renderer's input.

8
00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:25.879
Restore the window.

9
00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:28.534
The raster now carries both pictures at once.

10
00:00:29.714 --> 00:00:32.985
Video Source B and Dual Raster patch the same way.

11
00:00:32.985 --> 00:00:35.602
From here, everything is one cable away.
